BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 1631 Tm (size GroupLab measured dashed beside it, and a hole dragged with the select tool leaves the same dashed) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 1719 Tm (ghost. Done takes the changes back to the result, which measures again; leaving any other way asks whether to) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 1807 Tm (keep them. From the result: the bulls you fired at, Shots Needed to Zero, Ballistics with the group carried in,) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 1895 Tm (sharing the session, and sharing the shots as a CSV file. Import shots from a CSV file, under Sessions, shows) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 1983 Tm (the group as it will be read and a card of GroupLab's guesses at what each column is, each line tapped to) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2071 Tm (change, then Import and the result. Several files with the same columns can be chosen at once and are read as) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2159 Tm (one group.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2282 Tm (Sessions, Ballistics and Targets. Sessions keeps every result, each named by its load, date and time; tick two or) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2370 Tm (more to compare loads, one figure at a time: each load's name on a line of its own, and its range and value) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2458 Tm (beneath. Extreme spread has no range there, so it says so and points you to mean radius. In All figures, a value) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2546 Tm (too long to sit beside its name goes on the line under it. Ballistics is a tab of its own: the dope, the trajectory and) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2634 Tm (the chance of a hit. Targets prints a sheet through Android's print dialog or shares its PDF, and prints the printer) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2722 Tm (check page; on Android it also prints straight to a Phomemo M834 over Bluetooth at true size, without the) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2810 Tm (Phomemo app, with Paper in the M834 for a roll \(fed 15.5 mm further so the sheet clears the tear bar\) or fanfold) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2898 Tm (sheets; thermal roll paper curls, so flatten a sheet \(rolled the other way, or under a heavy book\) before scanning) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2986 Tm (it; at the range a clip or tape is enough; Settings, under Printers, checks your printer. On a large screen, such as) Tj ET
